Cat Clip Composer v0.1.21

This file has no added file-type extension and is the distributable version marker. Its filename must match the application version.

Changes since v0.1.20:
- Show the splash for at least five seconds on the first successful launch of an installation.
- Persist first-startup completion in the portable INI after successful editor initialization.
- Keep later normal startups visible for a minimum of approximately three seconds.
